%% SPD pipeline - end-to-end data flow (ARCHITECTURE §6)
flowchart TD
    CLI["CLI entrypoint (spd run)"] --> LOAD["Load dataset<br/>(discover outlets + images)"]
    LOAD --> EMBED["Embed images<br/>(DINOv2/CLIP adapter)"]
    EMBED --> SCORE["Score similarity<br/>(cosine + centroid + kNN)"]
    SCORE --> DETECT["Detect outliers<br/>(ensemble + adaptive threshold)"]
    DETECT --> ASSEMBLE["Assemble per-outlet result<br/>(schema-validated)"]
    ASSEMBLE --> WRITE["Write output<br/>(results.json + results.csv)"]
    WRITE --> REPORT["Generate write-up<br/>(metrics + rationale)"]

    subgraph CACHE["Embedding cache (content-addressed)"]
        C1["get(hash)"] --> C2["put(hash, vector)"]
    end
    EMBED <--> CACHE

    subgraph XCUT["Cross-cutting"]
        CFG["Config (settings.py + .env)"]
        OBS["Observability (structlog + timing)"]
    end
    CLI -.-> CFG
    LOAD -.-> OBS
    EMBED -.-> OBS
    SCORE -.-> OBS
    DETECT -.-> OBS
    WRITE -.-> OBS
